	)
	(text "ISOUSB211 internal 1.8 V LDO outputs (VCCx = 3.3 V). Per TI SLLSFC5D sec. 8.3: one 2.2u + 100n + 10n set\nat EACH V1P8V pin, smallest value closest, no vias between cap and pin/GND pin. Join pin 4 to 11\n(and 18 to 25) AFTER the caps, on an inner/bottom layer. Side 1 = GNDD (Pi), side 2 = GND (isolated)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 243.84 0)
