			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "755fcc5c-1658-4f9d-9c33-491d51f95751")
	)
	(text "F1: T4A time-lag TE5 (Littelfuse 39214000000, DigiKey F5505CT-ND), at J16 ahead of U4/U7. Supply RS-25-5 (5 A,\nhiccup at 110-180 %). F1 clears sustained faults above TPS22975 6 A rating. Keep RS-25 at 5.1 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.85 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87cbd3d0-a52c-4522-89b1-f5fc50cca79e")
	)
	(text "Front-panel / Pi GPIO interface (all GNDD)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 276.86 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93a7746f-ec77-49f8-b0e3-a61dabf09241")
	)
	(text "Place 220u at J16; 10u at U4 VIN/VBIAS; 10u at U4 VOUT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 207.645 236.855 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9aa0118a-9fce-49f1-bf4c-da6f4992e4b1")
	)
	(text "pins 25/26"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 82.55 221.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a3a19b7f-112e-42b2-9bb5-f19876f373d9")
	)
	(text "Pi config.txt (verify on target):\n dtoverlay=gpio-shutdown,gpio_pin=23,active_low=1,gpio_pull=up\n dtoverlay=gpio-poweroff,gpiopin=22,active_low=0\nGPIO23 (PI_SHUTDOWN_REQ): Q1 open drain, Pi internal pull-up. Pulse LOW >= 500 ms.\nGPIO22 (PI_SAFE_TO_OFF): LOW at reset (BCM pull-down + R2) and while running; driven HIGH\n only by gpio-poweroff after halt. Keep EEPROM POWER_OFF_ON_HALT=0 so 3V3 stays up after halt.\nATtiny firmware: after enabling U4, ignore PA3 until it has read LOW for >= 2 s; cut power\n only after PA3 HIGH stable >= 500 ms. Long press 5 s = forced OFF. Never enable PA3 pull-up.\nJ2 pin 8 PI_BUTTON2: harness pass-through, front button 2 -> Pi GPIO (no on-board circuit)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 276.86 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c0f5eb9f-1fe4-4a26-9438-62edca115705")
	)
	(text "pins 11/12"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 82.55 196.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6a5f953-0771-432a-9cbc-1da637b3ae10")
	)
	(text "ISOUSB211 power-good LEDs: D1 = side 2 up (Pi side, GNDD), D2 = side 1 up (isolated, GND).\nV*OK VOH = V3P3Vx-0.2 V @ 3 mA, abs max 10 mA. Use 570 nm GaP green (Vf ~2.1 V):\n680R gives ~1.5 mA. Do NOT fit an InGaN green (Vf ~3 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.555 222.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ca4d06c5-a7c6-437b-b989-7df077c35bfa")
	)
	(text "ISOLATION: GNDD (Pi side) and GND (isolated USB side) must never join.\nOnly U1 and U10 straddle the barrier. J1 shell is not connected (NPTH pegs only):\nJ1 must not contact an earthed / GNDD-bonded panel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 100.33 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cde9c58e-ac20-4b1e-9876-1a3a6e67bdf3")
	)
	(text "pins 4/3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44.45 196.16 0)
